{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"id":"Brave.BraveOrigin.Nightly","latestVersion":"158.1.101.44","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.674c550f.png","priority":1,"sha256":"674c550f00f6aacda7b02804b394c9902a7f6efe49adb67a7c829d32e1657e8b","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"Brave Software, Inc.","copyright":"Copyright © 2026 The Brave Authors. All rights reserved.","copyrightUrl":"https://brave.com/terms-of-use","description":"The untested—but stable—version of Brave Origin for advanced users and developers.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"FAQ","DocumentUrl":"https://brave.com/faq"}],"license":"MPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/blob/master/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Brave Software, Inc.","copyright":"Copyright © 2026 The Brave Authors. All rights reserved.","copyrightUrl":"https://brave.com/terms-of-use","description":"The untested—but stable—version of Brave Origin for advanced users and developers.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"FAQ","DocumentUrl":"https://brave.com/faq"}],"license":"MPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/blob/master/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Brave Origin is a paid* version of the browser for users who don’t need all the features that support Brave as a business, but still want the privacy that only Brave offers. Origin users will continue to benefit from our industry-leading privacy, adblock, and speed (via Shields), as well as regular software updates, Chromium patches, and security and privacy improvements. Origin will remove** most other features from the browser.\n* Origin is available as a free download for Linux desktop users.\n** If you opt to use Origin as an upgrade to the existing version of Brave on your device, you’ll unlock a new Settings panel where you can toggle features on / off as you wish.","name":"Brave Origin Nightly","packageUrl":"https://brave.com/origin/download-nightly/","privacyUrl":"https://brave.com/privacy/browser","publisher":"Brave Software Inc","publisherUrl":"https://brave.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://brave.com/latest","tags":["browser","chromium","internet","privacy","web","webpage"]},"zh-CN":{"copyright":"版权所有2026 Brave Software Inc。保留所有权利。","description":"适用于高级用户和开发者的未经测试但稳定的 Brave Origin 版本。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"常见问题","DocumentUrl":"https://brave.com/zh/faq"}],"locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Brave Origin 是一款付费* 浏览器版本，面向不需要 Brave 商业支持功能但仍希望获得仅 Brave 提供的隐私保护的用户。Origin 用户将继续受益于我们在行业内领先的隐私保护、广告拦截和速度性能（通过 Shields），以及定期的软件更新、Chromium 补丁，还有安全与隐私方面的改进。Origin 将移除** 浏览器中的大部分其他功能。\n* Linux 桌面用户可免费下载 Origin 版本。\n** 如果您选择将设备上现有的 Brave 升级为 Origin 版本，您将解锁一个全新的设置面板，可根据需要自行开启或关闭各项功能。","publisherUrl":"https://brave.com/zh","tags":["chromium","互联网","浏览器","网页","隐私"]}},"longDescription":"Brave Origin is a paid* version of the browser for users who don’t need all the features that support Brave as a business, but still want the privacy that only Brave offers. Origin users will continue to benefit from our industry-leading privacy, adblock, and speed (via Shields), as well as regular software updates, Chromium patches, and security and privacy improvements. Origin will remove** most other features from the browser.\n* Origin is available as a free download for Linux desktop users.\n** If you opt to use Origin as an upgrade to the existing version of Brave on your device, you’ll unlock a new Settings panel where you can toggle features on / off as you wish.","name":"Brave Origin Nightly","packageUrl":"https://brave.com/origin/download-nightly/","privacyUrl":"https://brave.com/privacy/browser","publisher":"Brave Software Inc","publisherUrl":"https://brave.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://brave.com/latest","tags":["browser","chromium","internet","privacy","web","webpage"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/158.1.101.44/app.json